. *---------------------------------------------------------------
. * SECTION 3: COUNTY TABLES (2005-2016)
. *---------------------------------------------------------------
. * Source: county deer and all-cause tables from MS Public Safety (originals i
> n
. * dataRAW/DVCs/MS/ARCHIVE; sender in source.txt).
. * Deer tables: row 1 = year (first column of each year only), row 2 = severit
> y
. * (K fatal, I injury, O PDO). Blank cells are true zeros. All-cause tables ar
> e
. * kept only to check the crash-level totals in Section 4.
